# Trial-Size Trial by Water (outlands 148): the battlefield won while completed (a re-run; the entry holds for a completed
# quest). A SMN of level 20 who knows Leviathan (spell 300), the quest completed and the Mini Tuning Fork (GMs): the
# fork's trade to WP_Entrance, option 17, LEVIATHAN_PRIME_ASA-18 killed; 32001's finish: Leviathan known (no message), no
# scroll held: the Scroll of Instant Warp given (ITEM_OBTAINED), Norg fame +20 again, completeQuest again (no change).
char zone=CloisterOfTides pos=557.5,35.1,563.0 job=SMN lvl=20
spell 300
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByWater completed
item MiniTuningForkOfWater
login
trade WP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfWater x1  # completed: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                    # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill LEVIATHAN_PRIME_ASA-18               # won: 32001 (canSkipCS 1)
finish                                    # Leviathan known: nothing; the Scroll of Instant Warp; Norg fame +20; completed again
